f 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186295559} {:answer/id #uuid "78d3896b-7cc7-55d9-93d6-eb6dd98142c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186295927} {:answer/id #uuid "b29faf52-a539-5828-8e4c-ae2fdf02df18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296209} {:answer/id #uuid "b806ba99-6dbd-5acb-9131-b1acf13afbcb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296231} {:answer/id #uuid "ea97feea-c170-5169-adc6-b127b06a5058" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296513}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b806ba99-6dbd-5acb-9131-b1acf13afbcb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296231} :answer-field/id #uuid "bd28e05e-209e-5653-9366-8140063b7d1c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297026}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ffcc7b45-1246-5e48-a7e0-93379ccd5076" :question/math-academy-id "q-288451" :question/problem "The equation \n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+mx+c={x}^{2}+7x-5\n$$\n\nis true for all values of $x,$ where $m$ and $c$ are constants. What is the value of $m+c?$" :question/worked-solution "Since the equation is true for all values of $x,$ the expressions on both sides must be exactly the same. That means the coefficients of the matching powers of $x$ must be equal.\n\nLet's compare the coefficients:\n\n- The coefficient of $x$ on the left-hand side is $m,$ and on the right-hand side it is $7.$ So, we have \n\n$$\nm=7.\n$$\n\n- The constant term on the left-hand side is $c,$ and on the right-hand side it is $-5.$ So, we have \n\n$$\nc=-5.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the sum:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m+c & =7+(-5) \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
